This repository ships no third-party source, binaries, audio or bitstreams.
The rig builds third-party software from sources fetched at run time by the
scripts/pre-fetch-*.sh scripts, into the gitignored .cache/ directory:

- xlxd (GPL-3.0), https://github.com/LX3JL/xlxd
- codec2 (LGPL-2.1), https://github.com/drowe67/codec2
- AllStarLink 3 / app_rpt (GPL-2.0), installed from repo.allstarlink.org
  inside rig/Dockerfile.allstar
- NXDNReflector from NXDNClients (GPL-2.0), https://github.com/g4klx/NXDNClients
- P25Reflector from P25Clients (GPL-2.0), https://github.com/g4klx/P25Clients
- URFd (GPL-3.0), https://github.com/n7tae/urfd
- mrefd (GPL-3.0), https://github.com/n7tae/mrefd

scripts/pre-fetch-speech.sh fetches speech input (not shipped) into
.cache/speech/ and keeps 8 kHz resampled copies of 20 utterances per voice
there (a modification, marked by the 8k file names and SHA256SUMS):

- CMU ARCTIC voices cmu_us_bdl_arctic and cmu_us_slt_arctic,
  http://www.festvox.org/cmu_arctic/ , Copyright (c) 2003 Carnegie Mellon
  University: "free for use for any purpose (commercial or otherwise)";
  permission to use, copy, modify and licence, provided the copyright
  notice, conditions and disclaimer are retained, modifications are
  clearly marked and the original authors' names are not deleted.

Those components remain under their own licences. Transcoder images are
supplied by the user through TRANSCODER_IMAGE and are not part of this
repository.
